eenshots01.png", "id": "235918228322285", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_235918231655618_9200480916509836758_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rkUQgBdPMtUQ7kNvwHCd-dp&_nc_oc=AdnkL-YpBTIfDqNTk4x_tuItAD2nKMNjVEjaD1fdeXC9DxOcMUakDlSmwd2l-R0TD4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwg8V4VDCeqIo5tfbpmp6H8zS2Lf8yxhkr06a0xwHRDDg&oe=69BD5B1C"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots02.png", "id": "1202634946843386", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982715_1202634950176719_6841690957288523386_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5KHVWcTr6ekQ7kNvwG_uSiL&_nc_oc=AdkUmU0WLsuZiZggRnwznYIRUdqCI7EWkEzBbMxpTKqXFHJCnc3izG63-cuFDEWhKzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwVJV2FIYIeBPcndbIypUenRGl5imP0TVArBwArVFWRLw&oe=69BD35A5"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots13.png", "id": "528250488391317", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001721_528250491724650_1577659830106612444_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wf5J30d67BUQ7kNvwFVycga&_nc_oc=Adk2C1yk8zXs2BDcre9fi1tkrcG35j0e9NP2UTMElpRsWh6l3A40dt_7xKa-hMtD8Bo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy6qwEKDPUPJ_zV08R0BE8nsvV-BQE9tlt0kfY1iLtXHg&oe=69BD29EC"}, {"file_name": "SMVRFinalQuestScreenshots10.png", "id": "326371915829001", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_326371919162334_129873048362627550_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9IG8MIR41tMQ7kNvwGuS3jr&_nc_oc=AdkZe1KBa4YJ4QxiKXg6djaUVBXdkaOIsSL6eaMMP2pxd724wMdSwCCEOy0XZ7WBQ0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw43GGu0o0MVdVA8QMQzrvfiMrGagVDqxUe1hJ8qX23SA&oe=69BD2FAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusCover2560x1440VIDEOENDSLATEWITHLEGAL.png", "id": "321306219352083", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035305_321306222685416_4438699296036008856_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vu2W8w_BjRQQ7kNvwH0tEOp&_nc_oc=Adld1KZp3Fhwb0-HSidyCK5dPAUU5m6HBytj00WoSdiWvIoMNnlvFpM-ZKQYqDg5Jqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfweU52swqL0dP_0Amn5hOHIj0Q8QTjoIoxhuFMjtti3Gw&oe=69BD4F56"}, "display_name": "Sam and Max: This Time It's Virtual!", "keywords": ["Comedy", "Adventure", "Narrative", "Action", "Arcade"], "long_description": "Sam is a dog with a hat.  Max is a hyperkinetic naked rabbity thing.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police, the intergalactically famous agents of indiscriminately applied justice, now starring in their umpteenth video game, Sam & Max: This Time It\u2019s Virtual!  Even multimedia evil-slappers like Sam & Max could use a hand, and this time they\u2019re using the incomprehensible magic of virtual reality to invite the player into their off-kilter world for a furious day of monster-slaying, obstacle courses, responsibly discharged firearms, and, of course, saving the entire freaking world.\nKey features:\n\u2022Discover the horrible and socially relevant secrets lurking behind, under, and within Cap\u2019n Aquabear\u2019s rotting theme park!\n\u2022Push yourself to be the best of the best of the middling, as a dog and a naked rabbity thing harangue and cajole you through a bewildering assortment of Freelance Police Academy training challenges.\n\u2022Immersion so real you can feel Sam\u2019s breath on your neck!\n", "short_description": "Sam is a dog in a suit.  Max is his naked rabbity partner.  Together, they\u2019re the Freelance Police.  Jump into the not-quite-right world of Sam & Max via the wonder science of virtual reality, and join the multimedia darlings in their never-ending quest to slap the stupid grin off the face of evil."}]}, "developer_name": "HappyGiant", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://happygiant.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_nam